[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0006","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0543","title":"Microsoft Windows SSPI网络身份验证会话0特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 安全支持提供程序接口（SSPI）在处理网络身份验证请求时存在权限提升漏洞，攻击者可利用会话 0 中的身份验证处理缺陷提升权限。该漏洞影响 Windows 7、Windows 8.1、Windows 10 及 Windows Server 2008 R2、2012、2012 R2、2016、2019 等多个版本。攻击者需具备本地低权限访问权限，无需用户交互即可触发漏洞，成功利用可导致系统完全受控（机密性、完整性、可用性均受高影响）。Microsoft 已于 2019 年 1 月发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0543"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-01-08T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:20Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 1 月安全更新 KB4480970（Windows 10 版本 1803 / Windows Server 2016）或 KB4480969（Windows 10 版本 1809 / Windows Server 2019），通过 Windows Update 自动更新或手动下载安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在组策略中禁用 NTLM 身份验证的会话 0 网络令牌委派作为临时缓解措施，命令为：reg add \"HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Lsa\" /v LsaLookupNames /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f，随后重启系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106408","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0543","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46156/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0543","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46156","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0543.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/28e8ce8af73241917321442d8cbe49ad874668a1/cves/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0543.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dab254278a60adf6b8fb2b95188a4f609cd2e674/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0543.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0543.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0543.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5518e115c47ce67fd19a448733cb6cb562e79960/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0543.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5518e115c47ce67fd19a448733cb6cb562e79960/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-0543.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-0543.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0543.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0543.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0005","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0541","title":"Microsoft Windows MSHTML 引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"CVE-2019-0541是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0541"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-01-08T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:19Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2019 年 1 月安全更新（2019 年 1 月 8 日发布的 Office 累积更新），覆盖 Office 2010 SP2、Office 2013 SP1、Office 2016、Office 2019 及 Office 365 ProPlus。通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 手动下载安装。同时通过组策略禁用 Internet Explorer 11 的 MSHTML 引擎（设置 \"禁用 MSHTML 引擎\" 策略为已启用），或在防火墙层面拦截已知恶意域名和 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106402","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0541","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46536/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0541","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46536","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0541.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6e7571de2d083c2588093ee3ef73d1501282312b/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0541.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0541.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0541.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/47ec74f5faf5543ca791f6a1af1c075a0176bd75/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-0541.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-0541.rules","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-0541.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-0541.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/d317d6ee72998d35d8c5ca7e0ef825b37671d3e1/2019/CVE-2019-0541/README.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2019-0541.json","https://github.com/H4xl0r/CVE_2019_0541"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0005.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0708","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0708.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16057","title":"D-Link DNS-320 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"D-Link DNS-320 网络存储设备中的 login_mgr.cgi 脚本存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。该脚本对用户输入的命令参数过滤不严，未经验证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求，在设备操作系统上注入并执行任意系统命令，从而实现远程代码执行、完全控制设备或导致数据泄露。该漏洞影响 DNS-320 的 2.05.B10 及之前所有固件版本，攻击向量为远程网络访问且无需任何认证与用户交互，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重，已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16057"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:18:24Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0708.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0708.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0708.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0072","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0072.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"Quasar 框架 extend 工具原型污染漏洞","description":"Quasar 是一个基于 Vue.js 的前端框架，其 2.20.1 及之前版本中公开导出的 `extend()` 工具函数存在原型污染漏洞。当使用 `extend(true, target, source)` 进行深度合并时，攻击者控制的对象的键会被递归复制到目标对象中，但未对 `__proto__`、`constructor`、`prototype` 等原型污染关键属性进行过滤，导致攻击者可将恶意属性写入 `Object.prototype`。攻击者可通过向受影响应用传递包含 `__proto__` 属性的特制对象，实现原型链污染。该漏洞影响所有使用 Quasar 2.20.1 版本且将用户可控对象传入 `extend(true, ...)` 的应用，可能导致逻辑绕过、不安全默认选项注入、拒绝服务等安全风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["GHSA-3r53-75j5-3g7j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"请参考官方安全公告，及时安装安全更新或升级到最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T17:57:09Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0072.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0001","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0001.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"WSO2 服务器端请求伪造漏洞（SSRF）","description":"WSO2 产品 5.8.0 之前版本存在服务器端请求伪造漏洞。攻击者可利用 shindig Web 应用的 UI 小工具加载功能，通过修改特定 URL 参数使服务器向攻击者控制的地址发起 GET 请求，从而造成内部网络探测和信息泄露。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["NUCLEI-HTTP-VULNERABILITIES-OTHER-WSO2-2019-0598-YAML"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2019-01-01T00:00:00Z","remediation":"将 WSO2 产品升级至 5.8.0 或更高版本，以修复 shindig 组件中存在的 SSRF 漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-15T01:13:01Z","references":["https://docs.wso2.com/display/Security/Security+Advisory+WSO2-2019-0598"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0001.toml"}]